<Input id="email" size="md" />

import { Skeleton } from '@/components/ui/skeleton';

<Skeleton />

Size it through the style slot, and put aria-busy on the container it stands in for. The pulse stops under prefers-reduced-motion.

import { Spinner } from '@/components/ui/spinner';

<Spinner />

The mark is aria-hidden. Put aria-busy on the container being waited on, and announce the wait through a live region rather than the glyph.

